  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Institut Químic de Sarrià (IQS) or the Chemical Institute of Sarrià, is a prestigious private higher education institution in Barcelona, Spain. IQS manages two schools: IQS School of Engineering and IQS School of Management. Whether you're interested in chemistry, engineering, or business, IQS Barcelona offers a dynamic learning environment.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At IQS Barcelona, you’ll experience a vibrant student life surrounded by an international community. IQS organises a range of activities to keep you engaged beyond your classes. You can take part in Sports Day, IQBrunch, IQS Green Fridays, the Debate League, and other events, to make the most of your time at the campus. Plus, the university also prioritises your well-being. The SAP (Psychological Support Service) assists you with academic challenges, mental health concerns, and personal matters.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>IQS Barcelona does not provide on-campus housing. However, it collaborates with several student residences and housing platforms to assist you in finding the ideal living arrangement in Barcelona.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Sports</strong><br>IQS encourages an active lifestyle, offering you lots of sports activities. You can join one of IQS’s sports teams and compete in local and national leagues, including football, basketball, and volleyball.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>IQS has laboratories dedicated to each degree program. It is also home to the largest Biotechnology Laboratory for educational purposes in Spain. Some of the labs include the Neuro &amp; Digital Marketing lab, the IQS-SCIEX DEMO lab, the Biotherapies lab, the Thermal Analysis lab, and many more.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
